(NATIONAL HEALTH AUTHORITY - GOVERNMENT OF INDIA) Tj T*
(AYUSHMAN BHARAT - PRADHAN MANTRI JAN AROGYA YOJANA \(AB PM-JAY\)) Tj T*
T*
(1. SCHEME OVERVIEW) Tj T*
(Ayushman Bharat PM-JAY is the world's largest health assurance scheme fully financed by the government. It aims to provide health cover of Rs. 5 lakhs per family per year for secondary and tertiary care hospitalization.) Tj T*
T*
(2. BENEFITS & FINANCIAL COVERAGE) Tj T*
(A defined benefit cover of Rs. 5,00,000 per family per year on a family floater basis. It covers up to 3 days of pre-hospitalization and 15 days post-hospitalization expenses such as diagnostics and medicines. There is no restriction on family size, age or gender. All pre-existing conditions are covered from day one.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
