(3. ELIGIBILITY CRITERIA) Tj T*
(Beneficiary households are identified from the Socio-Economic Caste Census \(SECC 2011\) database based on deprivation criteria:) Tj T*
(- Rural: Families living in only one room with kucha walls/roof, female-headed households with no adult male member aged 16-59, disabled members, SC/ST households, landless households deriving major income from manual casual labor.) Tj T*
(- Urban: 11 defined occupational categories \(ragpickers, domestic workers, street vendors, construction workers, transport workers, etc.\).) Tj T*
(- Senior Citizens \(70+ years\): Comprehensive health coverage expanded for all citizens aged 70 years and above irrespective of income.) Tj T*
T*
(4. REQUIRED DOCUMENTS & AYUSHMAN CARD) Tj T*
(Aadhaar Card or Ration Card is required to verify identity. Once verified, the citizen receives the PVC Ayushman Card free of charge.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
