(5. HOW TO AVAIL TREATMENT) Tj T*
(Treatment is completely cashless and paperless at all empaneled public and private hospitals across India.) Tj T*
(Citizens can check their eligibility at:) Tj T*
(a\) Official Portal: beneficiary.nha.gov.in or pmjay.gov.in) Tj T*
(b\) National Helpline: 14555) Tj T*
(c\) Ayushman Mitra kiosk at any empaneled hospital.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
